<title>UK: Sears Roebuck sets $500 mln June 2007 bond.</title>
<headline>Sears Roebuck sets $500 mln June 2007 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Goldman Sachs.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SEARS ROEBUCK ACCEPTANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    15.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE   S01.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  45 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD AREA +62.5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    ** TO BE PRICED			S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A-	  DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DELAWARE  HOME CTRY  U.S.A     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  30 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 2007 U.S.T</p>
<p> NOTES	UNSECURED.    GLOBAL.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
